From d188f4f1eefc15d4038b19c2c8076cbcc03369ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(gitops): build the workflow files from the picked
 databases (BYT-10423)

generateWorkflowFiles returns every file for the identity's git provider:
one deploy job per environment in deploy order, the default branch read
at run time, and the migration folder as the trigger and file pattern.

No job has a sign-in step. bytebase-action signs in as
BYTEBASE_WORKLOAD_IDENTITY with the job's own ID token (#21974): GitHub
jobs get `id-token: write`, GitLab jobs pass the token as
BYTEBASE_ID_TOKEN.

The old generators stay until the page moves to the new one.
---
